scdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819396_1031230115725693_652739831860027248_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uMUBLfwPk7YQ7kNvwF84P32&_nc_oc=AdqI01RMJOI8E0wFKUAVnntisL_xo1JT8Sn6ujmsomxqpxbE2Misyosr94yOVICYXiM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQExtzT963qBKyJOj0HAn0Vo20PHKjxMbjFdOMtyphYiYQ&oe=6A84390D"}, "display_name": "Walkaaos", "keywords": ["Action", "Intense", "Roguelite", "Arena", "Chaos"], "long_description": "# Welcome to the arena!\n\nWalkaaos is a 50 level tower where each level is a procedurally generated challenge in which you have to destroy all the drones within a time limit. Choose your weapons, pick your perks and start the elevator.\n\n{1036479328661058}\n\n**Close** or **far**?\n\n**Pew pew** or **boom**?\n\n**Health kit** for survivability?\n\n**Grappling hook** for closing the distance?\n\n**Knockback mines** for insane jumps and blasting drones away?\n\n# All of those and more\n\nChoose your equipment from 14 different weapons and gadgets on early access release with more planned for future.\n\n{1050018537294176}\n\n# Play your way with perks!\n\nVariety of perks like damage up, movement enhance, faster bullets, bigger explosions, max health and heal per kill.\n\nUnlock perks each level you complete in the main arena and customize your build for future runs from the perks you have previously unlocked.\n\n{2212306985878386}\n\n# Tower of chaos\n\nOver 100 arena layouts from very gentle and minimalist patterns to crazy hills and towers with a variety of traps.\n\n{1260952575822537}\n\n# Fight to survive\n\nWalkaaos has many different drones to destroy and traps to avoid. Both of which can also level up throughout the tower, so be mindful of their new tricks.", "short_description": "Fast and chaotic gameplay with roguelite elements. Fight drones in procedurally generated challenges. Choose your weapons and modify your playstyle with perks."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://si